  1 | Alice | alice@example.com | Thu Jan 01 10:00:00 2026 | 101 |       1 |  50.00 | paid
  1 | Alice | alice@example.com | Thu Jan 01 10:00:00 2026 | 102 |       1 |  75.50 | shipped
  1 | Alice | alice@example.com | Thu Jan 01 10:00:00 2026 | 103 |       2 |  20.00 | cancelled
  2 | Bob   | bob@example.com   | Fri Jan 02 11:00:00 2026 | 101 |       1 |  50.00 | paid
  2 | Bob   | bob@example.com   | Fri Jan 02 11:00:00 2026 | 102 |       1 |  75.50 | shipped
  2 | Bob   | bob@example.com   | Fri Jan 02 11:00:00 2026 | 103 |       2 |  20.00 | cancelled
  3 | Carol |                   | Sat Jan 03 12:00:00 2026 | 101 |       1 |  50.00 | paid
  3 | Carol |                   | Sat Jan 03 12:00:00 2026 | 102 |       1 |  75.50 | shipped
  3 | Carol |                   | Sat Jan 03 12:00:00 2026 | 103 |       2 |  20.00 | cancelled
