   2 | Bob   | user@example.com | Fri Jan 02 11:00:00 2026 | 102 |       1 |  75.50
   2 | Bob   | user@example.com | Fri Jan 02 11:00:00 2026 | 103 |       2 |  20.00
   3 | Carol | user@example.com | Sat Jan 03 12:00:00 2026 | 101 |       1 |  50.00
   3 | Carol | user@example.com | Sat Jan 03 12:00:00 2026 | 102 |       1 |  75.50
   3 | Carol | user@example.com | Sat Jan 03 12:00:00 2026 | 103 |       2 |  20.00
